<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/Regulation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Regulation represents a rule or directive maintained by an authority."@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/ExpandedLicensing/ListedLicenseException> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A ListedLicenseException represents an exception to a License (in other words,\nan exception to a license condition or an additional permission beyond those\ngranted in a License) which is listed on the\nSPDX License Exceptions <https://spdx.org/licenses/exceptions-index.html>."@en .
