<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/support> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/> .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/exportControlAssessment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A reference to an export control assessment for a package."@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/ResponsibilityType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Specifies the type of responsibility held over an asset, property, or entity."@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SimpleLicensing/licenseListVersion> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Recognizing that licenses are added to the\nSPDX License List <https://spdx.org/licenses/> with each\nsubsequent version, the intent is to provide consumers with the version of the\nSPDX License List used.\n\nThis anticipates that in the future, license expression can used a\nversion of the SPDX License List that is older than the then current one.\n\nThe specified version of the SPDX License List shall include all listed licenses\nand exceptions referenced in the expression."@en .
